; claude: code generation for tinybox: the build-time program that writes
; the menu's generated OCaml modules, Tinybox_data.ml (the catalogue and
; each program's size, ../codemap/deps: the menu's, ../menu),
; Tinybox_thumbs_k.ml and Tinybox_thumbs.ml (the thumbnails, in shards)
; and Tinybox_sources.ml (the repository's sources, for the code map):
; the native tinybox's, ../native; see make_tinybox_data.ml
; and ../menu/dune's and ../native/dune's rules
(executable
 (name make_tinybox_data)
 (modules make_tinybox_data)
 (libraries catalogue golden_scenes graphics_rgba graphics_png graphics_imaging tinybox_codedeps))

